        "Description": "Good afternoon, Agent 47. Berlin has forwarded unusual intelligence.\r\rThe area is filled with accessible weapons and hazards — propane tanks, shotguns, sniper rifles, and more.\r\rYour mission is simple: use the environment to eliminate the targets. Leave no unnecessary traces, and make every death appear accidental.\r\rThe assassins are actively searching for you. But remember, 47 — the best hunters are those who become the trap itself.\r\rGood Luck 47.",
